# Version bump

After every change, update all of these to the same new version:

- `pyproject.toml` (`project.version`)
- `src/benedict/__init__.py` (`__version__`)
- `README.md` (the Version line)
- `CHANGELOG.md` (a dated section under Keep a Changelog)

Patch bump for docs, rules, and fixes. Minor bump for user-visible features.
